<!--

Verify that:
    - node/1 should lose duplicate status (but remain orphan)
    - node/2 should lose duplicate status (but remain orphan)
    - node/3 should lose shared_node status
    - node/4 should remain in shared_node status
      (moved from one coincident location to another)
    - node/5 should become a duplicate orphan
